WEBVTT

00:01:36.390 --> 00:01:39.260
Please, please take photo.

00:01:39.260 --> 00:01:41.010
Oh, geisha!

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:43.010
We eat sushi off your body!

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:52.300
Oh, too bad.

00:01:54.530 --> 00:01:57.990
Hey, that definitely hit!

00:01:57.990 --> 00:02:00.780
<i>Where</i> it hits is what's important!

00:02:01.690 --> 00:02:05.340
Mister, you can't miss this part!

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:06.410
Shit.

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:12.210
Jigen Daisuke. What made you decide to accept my offer?

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:16.170
I'm just a homeless and penniless guy.

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:20.750
Having some fun alongside a job didn't sound like a bad idea.

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:23.200
Why did you ask me in the first place?

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:27.470
It's hard to handle raw food by yourself.

00:02:27.470 --> 00:02:28.970
It'll lose its freshness.

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:32.480
Let's get started.

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:35.230
Thanks for playing.

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:44.070
I'll take this, at least.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:59.380
Now, now, ladies and gentlemen, come take a look!

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:01.720
You can pay on your way out!

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:05.190
The scariest part of all starts now!

00:03:05.190 --> 00:03:08.120
The moan you can here from back there is the snake woman!

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:10.180
Come one, come all!

00:03:15.780 --> 00:03:18.690
<i>What do you think of this disorderly place?</i>

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:24.750
<i>It's the best stage for these most excellent works of art to truly shine.</i>

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:28.480
Oh, sorry about that.

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:31.620
This is already the 15th time tonight.

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:35.310
<i>Placing the art at this very place</i>

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:39.880
<i>was the ideal of the last genius artist of the 20th century who pursued magic realism,</i>

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:42.880
<i>Natarle Aiden.</i>

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:50.010
Next is... oh, you'll be shocked!

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:57.480
A woman born deep in the Amazon between animal and man!

00:03:57.480 --> 00:04:01.190
These patterns were carved into her body from birth!

00:04:05.990 --> 00:04:09.200
A karma inherited from her parents...

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:13.580
A woman so pitiful to behold, it's like looking through a kaleidoscope!

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:33.470
She's...

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:38.980
<i>Natarle used this woman's body as his canvas.</i>

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:40.980
<i>A living painting.</i>

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:46.730
<i>You've never seen nor will you ever again see a woman of such worth.</i>

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:49.950
The price that you'll put on her...

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:52.120
Now then, how much will it be?

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:59.500
<i>Let's start at a million dollars!</i>

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:03.720
1.5 million!

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:05.230
<i>Next, 2 million!</i>

00:05:05.230 --> 00:05:06.300
3 mill!

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:07.200
3.5!

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:07.840
4!

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:09.170
4.2!

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:10.500
4.3!

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:11.450
4.5!

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:12.590
4.8!

00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:13.940
Shall we?

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:14.800
Yeah.

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:21.100
Isn't it a bit too early?

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:21.980
I didn't do anything!

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:37.290
See? I always hit the right spot.

00:05:40.550 --> 00:05:41.790
Not so fast!

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:44.250
You...

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:56.060
Stop, monster!

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:20.620
She <i>is</i> cute once you get a good look at her!

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:33.130
This is awful.

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:35.580
It's even all over her tongue!

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:37.500
No!

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:43.600
This woman can't even talk?

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:45.090
I wouldn't be surprised.

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:52.590
She's an artwork people enjoyed via the pattern and color change that occurred as she aged,

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:54.530
or so it seems.

00:06:55.320 --> 00:06:58.480
She was always treated like a painting,

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:02.580
and probably never educated like a human being.

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:05.790
What a horrid man.

00:07:06.740 --> 00:07:11.050
To make the very life of a woman into a work of art!

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:16.640
Here.

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:30.620
Hey, cut it out.

00:07:30.620 --> 00:07:34.420
If you fall in love with the goods, it could cause problems.

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:36.490
Don't be stupid! I—

00:07:48.130 --> 00:07:50.000
Would you mind handing that over?

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:52.560
So it <i>was</i> you.

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:54.130
Mine Fujiko!

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:57.380
That woman is mine.

00:07:57.780 --> 00:08:00.700
I'm weak against beautiful women.

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:04.900
Now that I know she's a beauty, I won't hand her over without a fight.

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:06.400
In that case,

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:08.390
I'll take her by force!

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:13.230
Stay close!

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:22.870
Mine Fujiko seems in a hurry tonight!

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:24.820
She must really want it.

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:30.560
If you are playing baseball...

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:31.520
Out!

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:32.410
Safe!

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:33.840
All right!

00:08:38.590 --> 00:08:41.090
Out!

00:08:48.310 --> 00:08:50.090
See ya later!

00:08:55.830 --> 00:08:59.470
Is there something you want, Mine Fujiko?

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:03.960
Then let's continue with the rare items.

00:09:04.430 --> 00:09:09.820
A pure gold teapot studded with 3 carat diamonds.

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:15.210
Next is "King of Fruits". You rarely see one at this size.

00:09:15.210 --> 00:09:18.020
And this is no doubt the masterpiece of the century!

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:19.220
Oh my!

00:09:19.220 --> 00:09:21.590
That's some item there.

00:09:21.590 --> 00:09:25.130
You can appreciate her as the highest form of art

00:09:25.130 --> 00:09:28.100
as well as the story of her life.

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:34.720
At the circus on front of the Hatami hot springs, this most excellent piece...

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:35.860
Fujiko!

00:10:35.950 --> 00:10:37.580
What's wrong, Fujiko?

00:10:48.740 --> 00:10:53.020
<i>I'll definitely make her mine.</i>

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:04.170
Watch your step.

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:08.240
A-there we go.

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:21.750
Is she serious?

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:23.260
The way she's shooting...

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:27.590
It's like she doesn't care if the merchandise gets damaged.

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:50.160
She's crazy!

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:04.020
That woman...

00:12:04.020 --> 00:12:06.390
She's forgetting herself.

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:18.790
She's... inhuman.

00:12:26.690 --> 00:12:28.080
We're getting out!

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:30.830
What? At this height?

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:32.330
Now!

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:34.880
1...

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:36.380
2...

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:37.880
3...

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:39.380
4!

00:12:52.320 --> 00:12:53.470
Think she's dead?

00:12:53.470 --> 00:12:54.800
Dunno.

00:13:07.380 --> 00:13:11.410
If she dies in such a remote place, then I guess this is as far as she could go.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:15.920
Oh?

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:41.400
It's not just Mine Fujiko.

00:13:42.470 --> 00:13:46.100
Lupin is hiding something, too.

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:58.510
You might find it difficult to be happy with such a burden weighing you down.

00:13:59.410 --> 00:14:00.340
But...

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:04.340
All the same, be happy.

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:20.860
They called her a "living painting" or something.

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:23.700
It's above our heads.

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:26.680
A dark-robed something, the mafia or whatever.

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:29.680
If some character like that actually showed up, what would you do?

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:50.800
Well...

00:14:50.800 --> 00:14:53.040
Did she really die?

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:15.270
Amazing!

00:15:15.270 --> 00:15:17.370
I should've brought a camera.

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:19.600
If my wife saw her, she'd be shocked.

00:15:25.600 --> 00:15:26.580
What?!

00:15:44.890 --> 00:15:45.710
What's going on?!

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:47.530
What do you want, you bastard?!

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:24.770
Let's go.

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:43.530
Catch!

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:46.340
Bye, bye, bye~

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:48.760
I won't let you get away!

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:51.510
Damn, I can't move!

00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:04.020
Ru-ra-ru-rub-a-dub-dub, scrub in the tub-tub~

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:08.400
How about it, Fujiko? Wanna get naked and hang out with us?

00:17:14.320 --> 00:17:16.030
Too bad!

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:22.800
Laters!

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:31.510
This water is from a natural spring. You'll get boiled!

00:17:45.400 --> 00:17:48.100
10 points! 10 points! 10 points!

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:10.810
You've got nowhere else to run.

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:11.780
Hold it.

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:15.800
We're surrounded by highly concentrated natural gas.

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:20.810
If I set fire to it with this, we're dead.

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:24.350
What are you going to do with this woman?

00:18:24.350 --> 00:18:26.310
Huh? You're so annoying.

00:18:26.310 --> 00:18:27.620
I'm going to capture her.

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:29.410
If I sell her, I can make good money—

00:18:29.410 --> 00:18:32.990
Then there's no need to be so violent, right?

00:18:32.990 --> 00:18:36.830
If you hurt her even a little, the value of the painting goes down.

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:43.760
You actually want to kill her, don't you?

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:45.580
No, that's not it.

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:49.460
The one you want to kill is yourself.

00:18:50.960 --> 00:18:53.960
Your life has been manipulated by others.

00:18:55.820 --> 00:19:02.380
Everything in your life—stealing, eating and even breathing—has been controlled by others.

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:07.590
Your life was ruined by others,

00:19:07.810 --> 00:19:12.840
but you were forced to keep living nonetheless, powerless and pitiful.

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:18.030
You feel a connection with this woman who is similar to you.

00:19:18.600 --> 00:19:20.870
Isn't that right, Mine Fujiko?

00:19:23.690 --> 00:19:24.620
Then,

00:19:25.120 --> 00:19:26.300
Lupin,

00:19:28.360 --> 00:19:30.250
what should I do?

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:32.750
Should you be asking <i>me</i> that?

00:19:43.250 --> 00:19:45.100
Stop that.

00:20:01.620 --> 00:20:05.880
Oh, I forgot to tell you! That's a water gun.

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:14.340
Wait, Mine Fujiko.

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:17.400
If you shoot, we're all dead.

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:23.640
Hey, what do you know about that woman?

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:26.860
I won't tell you so easily.

00:20:27.590 --> 00:20:29.640
In my mundane life,

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:33.150
I've finally found a treasure.

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:51.060
It's like she's a living mandala.

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:54.630
Should we leave the rest to Buddha?

00:21:02.630 --> 00:21:04.020
What's with him?

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:13.050
What...
